{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ae3fd38174fc4ed37e97d9dd0368947e54a2afb95d12e2bbd5d1e0140b3bf039", "ja": "（『アイドルヒーローズ』シリーズ撮影中の琴葉。\n今日は衣装の着こなしを練習したいとお願いされ……）", "zh": "（正在拍摄《偶像英雄》系列的琴叶。今天，她拜托我陪她练习服装的穿法……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "0201a3a3170bb659367ae672b2c5021b1e3f26e3878e4b9a3dd39c7dde0b004c", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}。\n忙しいのに、無理を言ってしまって。", "zh": "抱歉，{$P$}。\n明明您很忙，我还提出了任性的请求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "322acb5a4d5f39816d3f07ca3b492704beb4cc7fa806d58086f52c5c976c2ebd", "ja": "今回はアクションも多い役ですし、\nいつもと違う動きを試しておきたくて。", "zh": "这次的角色有很多动作戏，所以我想先试试和以往不同的动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8cfbb48a06b7f8666f457093c42567b339ba4bb0435df4c7aa6e7ff02240ebe8", "ja": "構わないよ。そういう準備も大事だよな。", "zh": "没关系。这样的准备也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "c1745253ac0b02034ded98fbb12cf1ab53d77ce47077e76fbc1c1f37bdef3429", "ja": "はい。総帥としての貫禄も必要だし、\n着てるだけじゃ説得力が足りないと思うんです。", "zh": "是的。作为总帅，也需要有相应的威严。光是穿着它，我觉得还是缺乏说服力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5706fc0780cf21a28b846948ef5eb7b2d22022328211014aac9acce25c590273", "ja": "シンプルなわりに、重厚な雰囲気だよな。派手じゃ\nない分、着る人の雰囲気がものを言いそうというか。", "zh": "看起来虽然简约，却很有厚重感啊。不够华丽，反而更能体现穿着者本身的气质吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "568c6edb9c9bd7ab6d357a64ea547e33dedd76453c5c75ece8c6a14664ac436c", "ja": "そうなんです。キャラクターに合わせた衣装だからこそ\n私の努力がものをいうんだろうなって。", "zh": "是的。正因为是配合角色设计的服装，我的努力才会起到关键作用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "eaacb0909fe02c58a4d36f28ecf8be27e75f239137307db3571ebfd523f636dc", "ja": "彼女の魅力を表現できるかは、私がこの衣装を\n着こなせるかどうかにかかっていますよね。", "zh": "能不能表现出她的魅力，就取决于我能不能\n驾驭好这套服装了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1008_p", "source_sha256": "15184ccac5351f407d53ce21d11cd9e499b6f0da3ddc44f59a6d174cf04bf6af", "ja": "うん。でも、そういうことならよく似合ってるとは\n思うよ。着こなしも、見た感じ違和感はないけど……。", "zh": "嗯。不过，既然是这样，我觉得确实很适合你。穿搭看起来也没有什么违和感，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "e907bf5fb47106b59661eadeda82537f3d299917c2f35d831a575399ddbbbab9", "ja": "ありがとうございます。でも……私はまだ、\n着こなしているというよりも、着られている感覚で。", "zh": "谢谢您。但是……我总觉得\n比起穿出了衣服的韵味，更像是被衣服牵着走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "59c065763963760f2f53dc811a8f5b370098081919a46342bc0c63f3d2a5c4b1", "ja": "もっと雰囲気や、説得力……\nそういう細かいものを詰めていかないと。", "zh": "还必须在氛围感、说服力……\n以及各种细节上进一步打磨才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1011_p", "source_sha256": "877fb7e18389b3972e26827bb5e7b22e9092422774569b1132217df23c22b988", "ja": "雰囲気や、説得力か……。なんだか、申し訳ないな。\n浅い感想のようになってしまって。", "zh": "氛围和说服力吗……总觉得有点不好意思。\n结果听起来像是很肤浅的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "0982989e3f1a291be2b74e71a0415d5bcc887dd282aaa1870ea7db2d981a42d7", "ja": "い、いえ！　褒めてもらえるのは、嬉しいです！\nでも、もっと追及したいなって。", "zh": "没、没有的事！能得到您的夸奖，我很高兴！\n只是，我还想再多钻研钻研。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "b6568639466d34006a1e252308f8bf65d58696f6a14aec0c4093c9dd734e5fc1", "ja": "せっかく大きな役を頂いたので。\n似合ってるだけで、満足したくないんです！", "zh": "难得得到这么重要的角色。\n我不想只满足于看起来合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "f80ec80d507d5677f4dfc9b8a7e1ea0c19a2d9e62ae1d55ddb7088adbaef509a", "ja": "役もこの衣装も、ちゃんと私のものにしたくて。\nなので、あの……もしできれば、なんですが。", "zh": "我想把这个角色和这套服装，都真正变成属于我自己的东西。\n所以，那个……如果可以的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2780c4152b0f52fcee3e6fb65bcf9834b25c4f92323c14f254f315adb5563fea", "ja": "衣装、これからも借りたいって話か？\nそういうことなら構わないよ。", "zh": "是说以后还想继续借这套衣装吧？\n那没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1016_p", "source_sha256": "696e13fb13bac0679211e65929badfea063b18b2fa27a71087470a5d2be4ef15", "ja": "よかったら練習もつき合わせてくれ。\n琴葉がどこまで理想に近づけるか、見てみたいし。", "zh": "如果你愿意，也陪我一起练习吧。\n我也想看看琴叶能接近理想到什么程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "5184ee6e2955340e21677005de62999d02dad3db02b5d62465ebc16d71fe0fde", "ja": "あっ……ありがとうございます！\nますます、気合いが入りました！", "zh": "啊……谢谢您！\n我更有干劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0674_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "977348ae3d9a000c114500fc0c0313e6f39fc21a36ef2a4503716800361dab48", "ja": "やれることを全部やって、みんなが期待する……\nううん、期待以上の姿を見せられるよう、頑張ります！", "zh": "我会把能做的一切都做到，让大家期待……\n不，要努力展现出超越大家期待的样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
